      "parameters": {
        "color": "#FEEA87",
        "width": 540,
        "height": 924,
        "content": "## ☎️ Phone Validator — CRM Cleaner — Searchbug (api_lnp3)\n\nValidate a single phone number or a whole CSV — line type, carrier, VoIP, ported, DNC/TCPA flags, and more — straight from a web form into Google Sheets. Great for cleaning a CRM list.\n\n### How it works\n1. Enter ONE phone number, OR leave it blank and upload a CSV of numbers.\n2. Single or Bulk? routes the input; both paths merge at Normalize.\n3. Validate Phone filters out anything that isn't a 10-digit US number (saves API credits).\n4. Valid numbers are looked up via Searchbug and each result is saved to Google Sheets.\n\n### How to set up\n- [ ] Add your Searchbug co_code + pass in the Phone Validator node (Query Parameters — lowercase for this API)\n- [ ] Connect your OWN Google Sheets account in the Save node\n- [ ] Change the Document to your own spreadsheet + tab\n- [ ] Create a tab whose row 1 headers match the 17 field names below\n- [ ] Activate and share the form link\n\n### Columns saved\nphone, phone_type, carrier, voip, dnc, tcpa, ported, state, timezone, cnam, location_code, formatted_phone, lata, local_time, ocn, validated_at, validation_status\n\n### Customization\n- CSV works with a `phone` column (also accepts Phone / PHONE).\n- Add a Slack/email alert after Save."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "8a0351d7-9e78-4604-b982-e71ef39cafae",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        656,
        256
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1160,
        "height": 640,
        "content": "## 1. Enter & Validate\n\nSingle or Bulk? checks whether the phone field was filled. Single number → Set Single Phone; CSV upload → Extract CSV. Both merge at Normalize, then Validate Phone keeps only valid 10-digit US numbers (invalid ones are dropped so you don't waste API credits)."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "05474701-1472-4288-9f9b-77250e1741d6",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1856,
        256
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 720,
        "height": 640,
        "content": "## 2. Look Up & Extract\n\nClean Phone strips to digits, the Searchbug Phone Validator (api_lnp3) looks up carrier, line type, VoIP, DNC/TCPA and more, and Extract Results flattens the response into columns."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a5f02d6a-e0f0-46ea-9914-ccd93b45bf40",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
